02:32.870 --> 02:34.460
Si Hua pun tak masuk ke universiti.

02:34.550 --> 02:36.620
Nak membiayai Siyi, duit awak banyak sangatkah?

02:37.420 --> 02:39.480
Si Hua tak masuk ke universiti

02:39.510 --> 02:40.740
sebab dia tak lulus.

02:40.740 --> 02:42.110
Kalau dia lulus,

02:42.150 --> 02:43.760
saya akan membiayainya biarpun menjual darah.

02:44.350 --> 02:45.430
Mengarut.

02:46.020 --> 02:47.550
Siyi sendiri tak mahu belajar di universiti,

02:47.550 --> 02:48.480
